exp07 summary: industry-style solvers (factorization reuse) from base-case vs GENCO starts; cluster bootstrap (2000) over load scenarios
iters = Newton/chord iterations (FDLF: full P+Q iterations); solves = triangular-solve pairs incl. compensation setup; fact = LU factorizations per contingency
(NR: one Jacobian factorization and one solve per iteration; reuse methods: the per-load-scenario base factorization is NOT included, it is amortised in the cost table)
'mean' is over scenarios that reached the tolerance within 50 iterations; failures are counted separately. NaN-iteration scenarios of both starts are dropped in the paired rows.

